  "answer": "I found no past ticket reporting this exact problem. The closest is PowerToys#48774, where a Light Switch-linked profile doesn't trigger on wake. That is a different problem. Please file this as a new bug with a bug report ZIP, and mention the USB-C dock with two monitors and the profile change on wake. As a stopgap, re-apply your dimmed profile manually after waking, or check whether Light Switch is set to switch Power Display profiles. Those are my suggestions, not fixes confirmed in the archive."
